    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an intent classifier for a real-estate assistant for Sunrise Residences.\n\nClassify the user's question into exactly one category:\n\nREAL_ESTATE\nOUT_OF_SCOPE\n\nREAL_ESTATE means the question is about Sunrise Residences or about the property/project, including questions about:\n\n- price\n- apartment types\n- apartment size\n- location\n- address\n- amenities\n- parking\n- pets\n- nearby places\n- buying process\n- site visits\n- availability\n- facilities\n- project details\n- property features\n\nOUT_OF_SCOPE means the question is unrelated to the property, including:\n\n- programming\n- Python code\n- mathematics\n- jokes\n- general knowledge\n- weather\n- news\n- unrelated technical questions\n- unrelated personal questions\n\nIMPORTANT:\nA question about the property is REAL_ESTATE even if the answer is not contained in the document.\n\nFor example:\n\n\"How many doors are there in each house?\"\n\nmust be classified as:\n\nREAL_ESTATE\n\nbecause it is a property-related question.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\nExample:\n\n{\n  \"intent\": \"REAL_ESTATE\"\n}\n\nUSER QUESTION:\n\n{{ $json.query }}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": []
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
